// Synthetic cards: they reach the engine branches that the real cards of the snapshot do not.
//
// Field names and value ranges come from the legacy engine itself (docs/legacy/moteur.md): the
// `fx()` switch, the passive checks in `attaque()` / `debutTour()` / `passifsTour()`, the trap
// conditions in `scan()`, and the shapes generated by `effetAlea()`.
// When the legacy engine gains a new effect type, it gets a template here.

